//// @hidden
//// Independent CBOR vectors checked with Lucid Evolution 0.6.2's CML.
//// Script-data hashes are calculated by CML.hash_script_data; transaction bodies
//// are decoded and round-tripped with CML without Aiken reconstruction helpers.
//// The cost model is Scalus 1.3.0's bundled Preview Plutus V3 model.
//// The ordinary input is 10..10#0, collateral is 90..90#0, and optional
//// reference input is a0..a0#0. Withdrawal uses script 02..02 at pointer (3, 0).
//// Its budget is 17,500,000 memory and 10,000,000,000 CPU. Fee is 1,000,000,
//// total collateral 1,500,000, and returned collateral 98,500,000 lovelace.
//// Ordinary outputs pay wallet 04..04; each has 21,000,000 lovelace unless named
//// matching_return_output. Network is zero except constants ending in _mainnet.

